  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Humanitarian Response to Venezuelan Migrants, Refugees and Vulnerable Populations - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aligned with the 2022 Regional Refugee and Migrant Response Plan, the intervention aims to (1) improve access to protection, health and education services, (2) provide humanitarian assistance and support integration, and (3) strengthen the capacity of civil society organizations. 
Target: a) Venezuelan migrants, refugees and host communities in Colombia, Ecuador and Peru. b) Communities in border areas in Venezuela</narrative>
  </description>
